Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:45:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Integrate Options polish (labelled sliders, display
 settings w/ 15s revert, shared reset path) + stub fidelity fixes
 (CanvasScaler namespace, Screen display API, EventTrigger); add
 conformance/options docs

- UIFactory.SliderRow: label/track/value columns with positive offsets (labels were off-sheet)
- SettingsSystem: single owner of Screen state; prefs-persisted fullscreen+resolution
- GameLogic/DisplayPolicy: engine-free, unit-tested resolution policy
- GameRoot.RequestDataReset: F2x3 and Options share one confirm+reset path
- UnityStubs: CanvasScaler moved to UnityEngine.UI (the bug that broke the editor build)
